        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>三、解决问题（数学练习卷）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f4f2ee;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 640px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fffef9;\n    padding: 40px 55px 60px 55px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .q {\n    margin-top: 12px;\n  }\n  .sub {\n    margin-left: 18px;\n  }\n  .hand {\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n    color: #1b3fa0;\n  }\n  .hand.red {\n    color: #c02020;\n  }\n  .hand-line {\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .indent-1 { margin-left: 90px; }\n  .indent-2 { margin-left: 130px; }\n  .indent-3 { margin-left: 150px; }\n  .indent-4 { margin-left: 60px; }\n  .ans {\n    margin-left: 55px;\n  }\n  .fill-row {\n    margin-left: 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .fill-row .paren {\n    margin-left: 6px;\n  }\n  .frac-hand {\n    display: inline-block;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n    color: #1b3fa0;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .frac-hand .num { display: block; }\n  .frac-hand .bar { display: block; border-top: 1px solid #1b3fa0; }\n  .frac-hand .den { display: block; }\n  .bottom-block {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 150px;\n    height: 150px;\n    background: #2b2b2b;\n    color: #e8e8e8;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 4px;\n    margin-right: 30px;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">三．解决问题。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"q\">\n    1．小明吃了一个西瓜的 $\\frac{2}{8}$，小红和小明吃的同样多，两人一共吃了这\n  </div>\n  <div>个西瓜的几分之几？还剩几分之几？</div>\n\n  <div class=\"hand indent-1 hand-line\">$1-\\frac{2}{8}-\\frac{2}{8}=\\frac{4}{8}$</div>\n  <div class=\"hand indent-1 hand-line\">$\\frac{2}{8}+\\frac{2}{8}=\\frac{4}{8}$</div>\n\n  <div class=\"hand red ans\">答：两人一共吃了这个西瓜的 <span class=\"frac-hand\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"bar\"></span><span class=\"den\">8</span></span>，还剩 <span class=\"frac-hand\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"bar\"></span><span class=\"den\">8</span></span>。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"q\">2．一个盒子里装有一些玻璃球，其中黄球 2 个，红球 9 个，蓝球</div>\n  <div>8 个。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"sub\">（1）红球比黄球多占玻璃球总数的几分之几？</div>\n  <div class=\"hand indent-2 hand-line\">$2+9+8=19(个)$</div>\n  <div class=\"hand indent-1 hand-line\">红：$\\frac{9}{19}$　黄：$\\frac{2}{19}$　　$\\frac{9}{19}-\\frac{2}{19}=\\frac{7}{19}$</div>\n  <div class=\"hand red ans\">答：红球比黄球多占玻璃球总数的 $\\frac{7}{19}$。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"sub\">（2）黄球和蓝球一共占玻璃球总数的几分之几？</div>\n  <div class=\"hand indent-2 hand-line\">黄 $\\frac{2}{19}$　蓝 $\\frac{8}{19}$</div>\n  <div class=\"hand indent-2 hand-line\">$\\frac{2}{19}+\\frac{8}{19}=\\frac{10}{19}$</div>\n  <div class=\"hand red indent-4\">答：黄球和蓝球一共占玻璃球总数的 $\\frac{10}{19}$。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"sub\">（3）请你再提出一个和分数相关的数学问题，并解答。</div>\n  <div class=\"hand indent-1 hand-line\">问：蓝球比红球少占玻璃球总数的几分之几？</div>\n  <div class=\"hand indent-2 hand-line\">$\\frac{9}{19}-\\frac{8}{19}=\\frac{1}{19}$</div>\n  <div class=\"hand red ans\">答：蓝球比红球少占玻璃球总数的 $\\frac{1}{19}$。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"q\">3．填一填。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-block\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"fill-row\">①占整个图形的（<span class=\"frac-hand\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"bar\"></span><span class=\"den\">2</span></span>）</div>\n      <div class=\"fill-row\">②占整个图形的（<span class=\"frac-hand\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"bar\"></span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span>）</div>\n      <div class=\"fill-row\">③占整个图形的（<span class=\"frac-hand\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"bar\"></span><span class=\"den\">8</span></span>）</div>\n      <div class=\"fill-row\">④占整个图形的（<span class=\"frac-hand\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"bar\"></span><span class=\"den\">16</span></span>）</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[图形：右侧，正方形分割图（含对角线与分割线）]</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
